{"4875060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rich List: The Order", "steam_appid": 4875060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich List: The Order already offers a remarkably complete experience at its Early Access launch — but I still can't wait to show every Chairman just how ambitious this game truly is!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/89d5c6bccfec17466aadcf9bc2da6977.avif?t=1784186761\" width=1170 height=4812 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything on the roadmap is a promise we will deliver. Yet the community's suggestions have always shaped this game profoundly, and we will act fast on your voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chairmen, unleash your fortunes and turn this world upside down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a hundred ways money can grow. In <i>Rich List: The Order</i>, you will master them one by one: insider trading, financial strikes, supercars and luxury watches, tech empires, IPOs, short squeezes, media manipulation, high-stakes Texas Hold’em, and the unseen currents that never appear on balance sheets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Financial freedom is only the beginning: once you command trillions, the real game starts—markets tremble because of you, industries are reshuffled by you, and the fate of millions may be rewritten by a single decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/8dcf0515aa353f7d93b7b40472631d60.avif?t=1784186761\" width=1200 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/291d932f4aca1a83f6251a121cc82fcd.avif?t=1784186761\" width=1200 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The economy is not a set of numbers, but a living world that constantly reacts to you. Reading reports matters, but nowhere near as much as the web of connections and capital. You start as an ordinary worker, passively enduring cycles; at the top, every move you make becomes the source of a storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/9aa0044646e868b4484dc7e5c4e13683.avif?t=1784186761\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras_big/9aa0044646e868b4484dc7e5c4e13683.webp?t=1784186761 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/869f1dbeb71257e486bd5bf449179df6.avif?t=1784186761\" width=1200 height=220 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Information has a half-life, emotions have a price, and “stories” themselves are assets. You can lie in wait for years, ignite narratives to reprice assets, manipulate liquidity to create panic, and harvest gains between booms and crashes. Pump-and-dump, short attacks, hostile takeovers, short squeeze reversals—behind every fluctuation are wagers, bankruptcies, and laughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/b95b019850d7dbb67a8a69b91cf76d30.avif?t=1784186761\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras_big/b95b019850d7dbb67a8a69b91cf76d30.webp?t=1784186761 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/473505fa1bb8420b9a3a63755057639d.avif?t=1784186761\" width=1200 height=220 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your tech empire from scratch: product definition, R&amp;D trees, in-house chips, operating system ecosystems, in-car platforms, production scaling, funding, and IPOs. Complex systems are abstracted into strategic choices, letting you focus on decisions rather than micromanagement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/bcc81cb7b9bb62c645b1dc5693e07a68.avif?t=1784186761\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras_big/bcc81cb7b9bb62c645b1dc5693e07a68.webp?t=1784186761 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/ceaf64fd864eb0b838ce7d11b375ff14.avif?t=1784186761\" width=1200 height=220 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some doors cannot be opened by money alone. Private banks, members-only clubs, charity galas, old-money rules, and invisible power structures—you need more than wealth; you need recognition. Reputation itself is currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/14fc6adc9fd8a7f8e26323384c579efc.avif?t=1784186761\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras_big/14fc6adc9fd8a7f8e26323384c579efc.webp?t=1784186761 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/06d005e13d045b0ff0f1417011c94f78.avif?t=1784186761\" width=1200 height=220 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the casino, money sheds all disguise and becomes chips, probability, and heartbeat. Some mergers fail in boardrooms but are settled at 4 a.m. poker tables. A “god-tier night” is a table, a group unwilling to leave, and a public trial where fate is wagered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/b0f5874ee4a8932f77628b8c97e196ad.avif?t=1784186761\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras_big/b0f5874ee4a8932f77628b8c97e196ad.webp?t=1784186761 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/afe36eaa0a434ea2c7acf4542ec01ee2.avif?t=1784186761\" width=1200 height=220 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consumption is no longer need—it is language. The first suit is for interviews, the second for negotiations, the third makes others lower their gaze before you speak. Homes evolve from shared apartments to luxury penthouses to private islands, watches from digital timepieces to auction rarities. When you stop consuming for attributes, you begin mastering something real: the display of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/95b11aef95e8b63ac9902bd43097f3de.avif?t=1784186761\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras_big/95b11aef95e8b63ac9902bd43097f3de.webp?t=1784186761 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >｜More Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of interactive billionaire NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of branching events spanning decades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Family, relationships, and inheritance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich narrative unveiling a hidden world conspiracy</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a hundred ways money can grow. In <i>Rich List: The Order</i>, you will master them one by one: insider trading, financial strikes, supercars and luxury watches, tech empires, IPOs, short squeezes, media manipulation, high-stakes Texas Hold’em, and the unseen currents that never appear on balance sheets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Financial freedom is only the beginning: once you command trillions, the real game starts—markets tremble because of you, industries are reshuffled by you, and the fate of millions may be rewritten by a single decision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/8dcf0515aa353f7d93b7b40472631d60.avif?t=1784186761\" width=1200 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/291d932f4aca1a83f6251a121cc82fcd.avif?t=1784186761\" width=1200 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The economy is not a set of numbers, but a living world that constantly reacts to you. Reading reports matters, but nowhere near as much as the web of connections and capital. You start as an ordinary worker, passively enduring cycles; at the top, every move you make becomes the source of a storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/9aa0044646e868b4484dc7e5c4e13683.avif?t=1784186761\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras_big/9aa0044646e868b4484dc7e5c4e13683.webp?t=1784186761 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/869f1dbeb71257e486bd5bf449179df6.avif?t=1784186761\" width=1200 height=220 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Information has a half-life, emotions have a price, and “stories” themselves are assets. You can lie in wait for years, ignite narratives to reprice assets, manipulate liquidity to create panic, and harvest gains between booms and crashes. Pump-and-dump, short attacks, hostile takeovers, short squeeze reversals—behind every fluctuation are wagers, bankruptcies, and laughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/b95b019850d7dbb67a8a69b91cf76d30.avif?t=1784186761\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras_big/b95b019850d7dbb67a8a69b91cf76d30.webp?t=1784186761 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/473505fa1bb8420b9a3a63755057639d.avif?t=1784186761\" width=1200 height=220 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your tech empire from scratch: product definition, R&amp;D trees, in-house chips, operating system ecosystems, in-car platforms, production scaling, funding, and IPOs. Complex systems are abstracted into strategic choices, letting you focus on decisions rather than micromanagement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/bcc81cb7b9bb62c645b1dc5693e07a68.avif?t=1784186761\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras_big/bcc81cb7b9bb62c645b1dc5693e07a68.webp?t=1784186761 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/ceaf64fd864eb0b838ce7d11b375ff14.avif?t=1784186761\" width=1200 height=220 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some doors cannot be opened by money alone. Private banks, members-only clubs, charity galas, old-money rules, and invisible power structures—you need more than wealth; you need recognition. Reputation itself is currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/14fc6adc9fd8a7f8e26323384c579efc.avif?t=1784186761\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras_big/14fc6adc9fd8a7f8e26323384c579efc.webp?t=1784186761 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/06d005e13d045b0ff0f1417011c94f78.avif?t=1784186761\" width=1200 height=220 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the casino, money sheds all disguise and becomes chips, probability, and heartbeat. Some mergers fail in boardrooms but are settled at 4 a.m. poker tables. A “god-tier night” is a table, a group unwilling to leave, and a public trial where fate is wagered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/b0f5874ee4a8932f77628b8c97e196ad.avif?t=1784186761\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras_big/b0f5874ee4a8932f77628b8c97e196ad.webp?t=1784186761 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/afe36eaa0a434ea2c7acf4542ec01ee2.avif?t=1784186761\" width=1200 height=220 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consumption is no longer need—it is language. The first suit is for interviews, the second for negotiations, the third makes others lower their gaze before you speak. Homes evolve from shared apartments to luxury penthouses to private islands, watches from digital timepieces to auction rarities. When you stop consuming for attributes, you begin mastering something real: the display of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras/95b11aef95e8b63ac9902bd43097f3de.avif?t=1784186761\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/extras_big/95b11aef95e8b63ac9902bd43097f3de.webp?t=1784186761 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >｜More Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of interactive billionaire NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of branching events spanning decades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Family, relationships, and inheritance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich narrative unveiling a hidden world conspiracy</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A business simulation has never felt this epic. Trade stocks, build companies, take them public, unleash financial tidal waves, sit at the table of a high-stakes gambler’s night, and climb the Rich List. Then you realize: the other side of the board is called The Order.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Polish, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Korean, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/3ca95a917745bd99d48b0a8d5cbac3a3f06a69e1/header.jpg?t=1784186761", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/3f1f2144b8878583482586edaf539d77c30fa40c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784186761", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875060/3f1f2144b8878583482586edaf539d77c30fa40c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784186761", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong>  Windows 7+ (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:<